            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.116.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chiny. 116.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Liiandiko liboolanga lili, “Nalomaloma sikila nasuubila,” khubirira mu roho owe lisuubila mwenoyo, akhaba fwesi khulomaloma sikila khwasuubila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khumanyile khuli Wele, owalamusia Omwami Yesu, akhakhulamusie efwe fwesi ne Yesu mala akhubukule akhuyile efwe alala ne nanywe ebweeni wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano koosi kali sikila enywe; ne nga kumwalaalo kwa Wele kuchiililila khukhwolela babaandu bakali balaana lisaba likali lie khu khuupa orio khulwe luyali lwa Wele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Limenya lie lisuubila",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwe sifuno sino, se khufwa kumwoyo tawe. Akhaba liiba liefwe lienje ne lilikho likora kalaa, liiba liefwe lia roho lilikho likholwa liya buli ndaalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne butinyu butiiti bwe siise sitiiti nibwo khuli nabwo buno bulakhureera efwe mu luyali lukali lwa mindali lukhila butinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila se khura kimiooyo kiefwe khu biindu bibonekha tawe, ne kakhali khura khu bikhabonekha tawe. Bibonekhana binyala biabonekha khu siise sitiiti, ne kakhali bikhabonekha tawe bimenyanga mindali na mindali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
